[h1]脑雾尖塔 BrainFog[/h1]

一场发生在脑内的灾难。你还能操作，但认不出任何东西。

[list]
[*][b]卡牌失认[/b]：卡牌要打出/升级过一次才能认出来；奖励与选牌界面只显示稀有度
[*][b]文字失读[/b]：事件、菜单、提示、卡面与对话全部固定乱码（图鉴与设置除外）
[*][b]记忆失真[/b]：生命与金币停留在上次休息时；战斗血条不显示真实血量
[*][b]世界模糊[/b]：敌人只剩呼吸方框、名字隐藏、意图仅战斗首回合显示；遗物不可见、药水只剩轮廓、地图迷雾、Boss 信息隐藏
[/list]

依赖 STS2 v0.111.0 与 RitsuLib 0.6.2；仅单人；卸载即恢复原版。

Github链接：https://github.com/yM7-1/BrainFog

[hr][/hr]

[h1]BrainFog[/h1]

A disaster inside your own mind. You can still play — you just can't recognize anything.

[list]
[*][b]Card agnosia[/b]: cards stay unrecognizable until played or upgraded once; rewards and selection screens show rarity only
[*][b]Text alexia[/b]: events, menus, prompts, card text and dialogue are permanently garbled (compendium and settings stay readable)
[*][b]Faulty memory[/b]: HP and gold are frozen at your last rest; the combat health bar hides true HP
[*][b]Blurred world[/b]: enemies are breathing boxes with hidden names and intents only on the first combat round; relics invisible, potions outlined, map fogged, boss info hidden
[/list]

Requires STS2 v0.111.0 + RitsuLib 0.6.2. Single-player only; uninstall restores everything.

GitHub: https://github.com/yM7-1/BrainFog"
